From 95c5c1c2ac7846d0bfc1abe3a4e5e481beb9fab8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pieroviano <piero.viano@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 03:10:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Anchoring: status strip, re-parenting, hidden AutoSize, later
 ClientSize, scaling and runtime containers

Baselines and DisplayRectangle ignore a StatusStrip; a control leaving a container forgets its baseline and is baselined for the new parent; layout writes keep the unclamped bounds and no size request is stamped on an unconstrained axis; a form's later ClientSize or Size-only height change counts as a resize; Form.Scale/auto-scale re-base the children; controls added to a container outside SuspendLayout are baselined immediately.
